      100.488
    ]
  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "fontSize": 8,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        58.800000000000004,
        748.5121,
        9.600000000000001,
        9.312000000000012
      ],
      "text": "56"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 8,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        88.80000000000001,
        748.5121,
        167.2,
        9.312000000000012
      ],
      "text": "The Fed Explained: What the Central Bank Does"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        90,
        692.6401000000001,
        427.2919999999999,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "The Federal Reserve actively monitors indicators of the riskiness of SIFIs, both individually as well"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        90,
        676.6401000000001,
        411.4939999999997,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "as through interlinkages in the broader network of financial institutions, to help identify vulner-"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        90,
        660.6401000000001,
        426.241,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "abilities. It also imposes certain regulatory requirements on SIFIs in order to limit potentially risky"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        90,
        644.6401000000001,
        421.74199999999956,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "activities by these institutions and to mitigate spillover of distress into the broader economy. If a"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        90,
        628.6401000000001,
        426.8969999999998,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "SIFI were to become distressed, disruptions in the financial system could arise from direct losses"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        90,
        612.6401000000001,
        360.2429999999998,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "imposed on SIFI counterparties, contagion, fire sales, or a loss of critical services."
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        315,
        580.6401000000001,
        203,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "SIFIs are also subject to additional capital and"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        315,
        564.6401000000001,
        189.19699999999995,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "liquidity regulations imposed by the Federal"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        315,
        548.6401000000001,
        199.09899999999993,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "Reserve in order to help mitigate some of the"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        315,
        532.6401000000001,
        200.19799999999987,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "additional risks they pose to the financial sys-"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        315,
        516.6401000000001,
        197.49900000000002,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "tem as a whole, given their size and intercon-"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        315,
        500.6401000000001,
        53.80000000000001,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "nectedness."
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        315,
        468.6401000000001,
        201.54999999999995,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "Moreover, during the 2007–09 financial crisis,"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        315,
        452.6401000000001,
        199.79999999999995,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "the lack of effective resolution strategies con-"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        315,
        436.6401000000001,
        204.34699999999998,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "tributed to the pernicious spillovers of distress"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        315,
        420.6401000000001,
        197.59899999999993,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "at or between individual institutions and from"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        90,
        404.6401000000001,
        417.69499999999965,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "those institutions to the broader economy. The Federal Reserve, in collaboration with other U.S."
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        90,
        388.6401000000001,
        431.7419999999995,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "agencies, has continued to work with large financial institutions to develop a range of recovery and"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        90,
        372.6401000000001,
        423.3439999999998,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "resolution strategies in the event of their distress or failure. Improvements in resolution planning"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        90,
        356.6401000000001,
        426.14599999999984,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "are intended to, among other things, mitigate adverse effects from perceptions of “too big to fail”"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        90,
        340.6401000000001,
        427.59799999999973,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "and contribute to more orderly conditions in the financial system if institutions face strains or fail."
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        90,
        324.6401000000001,
        430.1439999999998,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "(For more information on recovery and resolution planning activity, see section 5, “Supervising and"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        90,
        308.6401000000001,
        266.246,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "Regulating Financial Institutions and Activities,” on page 62.)"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 14,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        90,
        275.6401,
        269.42859999999996,
        16.576000000000022
      ],
      "text": "Stress Testing of Key Financial Institutions"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        90,
        253.4401,
        405.69299999999976,
        11.640000000000015
      ],
      "text": "One important element of enhanced supervision of SIFIs is the stress testing process, which"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        90,
        237.4401,
        428.4939999999997,
        11.640000000000015
      ],
      "text": "includes the Dodd-Frank Act stress tests and the stress capital buffer rule. In addition to fostering"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        90,
        221.4401,
        431.1949999999996,
        11.640000000000015
      ],
      "text": "the safety and soundness of the participating institutions, the stress test program includes macro-"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        315,
        205.4401,
        124.80000000000001,
        11.640000000000015
      ],
      "text": "prudential elements such as"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        315,
        185.8401,
        197.20000000000005,
        11.840000000000003
      ],
      "text": "• examination of the loss-absorbing capacity"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        315,
        169.8401,
        204.29999999999995,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "of institutions under a common macroeconomic"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        315,
        153.8401,
        204.60000000000014,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "scenario that has features similar to the strains"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        315,
        137.8401,
        195.89899999999994,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "experienced in a severe recession and which"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        315,
        121.8401,
        183.59799999999996,
        11.639999999999986
      ],
      "text": "includes, as appropriate, identified salient"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 10,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        315,
        105.8401,
        24,
        11.64
      ],
      "text": "risks;"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 8,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        98.2,
        573.912,
        107.36,
        9.47199999999998
      ],
      "text": "Countercyclical Capital Buffer"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 8,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        98.2,
        558.312,
        177.12,
        9.312000000000012
      ],
      "text": "The Countercyclical Capital Buffer (CCyB) is an ele-"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 8,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        98.2,
        546.312,
        183.8376,
        9.312000000000012
      ],
      "text": "ment of the Federal Reserve’s regulatory toolkit. It is"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 8,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        98.2,
        534.312,
        179.11759999999998,
        9.312000000000012
      ],
      "text": "a macroprudential tool designed to support lending"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 8,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        98.2,
        522.312,
        182.87999999999994,
        9.312000000000012
      ],
      "text": "and economic activity when economic conditions de-"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 8,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        98.2,
        510.312,
        184.64,
        9.312000000000012
      ],
      "text": "teriorate. It augments minimum capital requirements"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 8,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        98.2,
        498.312,
        190.9912,
        9.312000000000012
      ],
      "text": "when there is an elevated risk of above-normal losses,"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 8,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        98.2,
        486.312,
        183.59679999999997,
        9.312000000000012
      ],
      "text": "thus making capital requirements countercyclical, as"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 8,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        98.2,
        474.312,
        109.03840000000001,
        9.312000000000012
      ],
      "text": "required by the Dodd-Frank Act."
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 8,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        98.2,
        458.712,
        139.24,
        9.312000000000012
      ],
      "text": "For more information, see https://www."
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 8,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        98.2,
        446.712,
        167.51999999999992,
        9.312000000000012
      ],
      "text": "federalreserve.gov/newsevents/pressreleases/"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 8,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        98.2,
        434.712,
        80.00000000000001,
        9.312000000000012
      ],
      "text": "bcreg20160908b.htm."
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 8,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        98.2,
        196.31210000000002,
        163.36,
        9.472000000000008
      ],
      "text": "“Stress testing” of large financial institutions"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 8,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        98.2,
        180.71210000000002,
        177.59679999999997,
        9.312000000000012
      ],
      "text": "In 2020, 33 institutions participated in the Federal"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 8,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        98.2,
        168.71210000000002,
        171.6368,
        9.312000000000012
      ],
      "text": "Reserve stress testing process, which occurs an-"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 8,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        98.2,
        156.71210000000002,
        177.43760000000003,
        9.312000000000012
      ],
      "text": "nually. For more information, see the “Stress Tests"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 8,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        98.2,
        144.71210000000002,
        165.51839999999999,
        9.312000000000012
      ],
      "text": "and Capital Planning” web page, located on the"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 8,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        98.2,
        132.71210000000002,
        175.19920000000002,
        9.312000000000012
      ],
      "text": "Board’s website (https://www.federalreserve.gov/"
    },
    {
      "fontSize": 8,
      "monospaced": false,
      "rect": [
        98.2,
        120.71210000000002,
        163.20000000000005,
        9.312000000000012
      ],
      "text": "bankinforeg/stress-tests-capital-planning.htm)."
    }
  ],
